// The shell icon: Explorer, the taskbar, Alt-Tab and the console window title.
// Windows reads the first RT_GROUP_ICON in the image, so the id is arbitrary.
//
// The icon file is found through `--include-dir`, which `build.rs` points at
// the repository's `assets/`; a bare name here therefore means
// `assets/baash.ico`.
1 ICON "baash.ico"
